epleted the lands, causing hunger and disease. The sun's rays have made many vegetables go crazy. Some of them have completely changed their personalities, becoming dangerous to others.\n\nJoseph Pommodorov became one such vegetable.\nHe used to be a good tomato. He loved Carrot Marx's philosophy, helped the poor, was well-liked and respected, but the sun's rays turned him into a monster.\n\nHe has manipulated red vegetables with his hatred of others, blaming the disaster on vegetables with different colored skin. He commissioned scientists to create a cruel variety of GMO PEPPER and began to conquer the world.\nIn a short time, he has taken over the world in a brutal and cruel way, calling himself emperor and ordering the enslaved vegetables to work for the red empire.\n\nThe oppressed vegetables have formed an \"underground\" organization in which the boldest, strongest and craziest vegetables are selected. They are trained for secret subversive missions and their battalion has become famous under the name \"Suicide Vegetables\". Their task is to destroy the enemy's plans, track down Joseph Pommodorov and smash him into Ketchup.", "summary": "A stealth adventure game with an absurd-driven story and third-person perspective for a single-player or co-op. Complete secret war missions, solve the showy puzzles, and save the veggies world!", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 23, "name": "Stealth"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}, {"id": 39, "name": "Warfare"}, {"id": 40, "name": "Party"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/kamikaze-veggies", "videos": [{"id": 58053, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "6jWIUbt1AQo", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6jWIUbt1AQo", "title": "Kamikaze Veggies - WORK IN PROGRESS #shorts", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/6jWIUbt1AQo/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 81040, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "jASDWrpqDWY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jASDWrpqDWY", "title": "Kamikaze Veggies - Release Trailer | PS5 & PS4 Games"